<title>FRANCE: Air France to ally with Delta, Continental - paper.</title>
<headline>Air France to ally with Delta, Continental - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French newspaper Le Monde said Air France was expected to announce a strategic agreement with U.S. airlines Delta and Continental on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
